~ sword
Your sword.
do setEntityVisibility("Sword", false)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "BrandishSword",false)
do wait(1)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "SheatheSword",false,true,true)
do wait(0.75)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "RESET")
=> map

~ bow
A bow.
do setEntityVisibility("Bow", false)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "DrawBow")
do wait(0.5)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "UndrawBow",false,true,true)
do wait(0.75)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "RESET")
=> END

~ map
do wait(0.1)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "Map_Check")
do wait(1)
Player: Alright... only...
Player: 2,167 more miles to go.
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "Map_Emote")
do wait(2)
Player: God damn it.
do wait(1)
do playEntityAnimation("Player", "RESET")
=> END

~ cutscene
do showCameraOverlay("Black",0)
do hidePlayer()
do moveCamera("CamMarker")
do zoomCamera(Vector2(2,2))
do showCameraOverlay("transparent",3)
do wait(5)
do setSpriteFrame("Willis",1)
do wait(2)
Willis: ...Do you wanna talk about it?
do setSpriteFrame("Archie",1)
Archie: About what?
Willis: The rebellion, what you’ve seen. What you’ve done.
do setSpriteFrame("Archie",0)
do wait(2)
Archie: I don't know.
Archie: It's...[wait=0.5] a lot.
Willis: That’s fair. 
Willis: Something more topical then.
do setSpriteFrame("Willis",0)
Willis: You think it'll be any better Eastside?
Archie: ...
do setSpriteFrame("Archie",1)
Archie: Y’know what’s funny? 
Archie: After everything we’ve been through- 
Archie: I do think things will be better.
Archie: Guess that makes me a fool huh?
Willis: No.
do setSpriteFrame("Willis",1)
Willis: I think it's strong actually.
Willis: To hold on to hope despite everything.
Archie: I think it's stupid.
Archie: What good did my hope do?
Archie: It's how [color=red]he[color=white] sunk his teeth in me.
Archie: Got me thinking I was fighting for a better tomorrow.
Archie: When I was only fighting another pointless war.
Archie: I thought I could be a hero.
Archie: And you all paid for it.
do setSpriteFrame("Archie",0)
do wait(2)
Archie: It was selfish.
Archie: I never should've left.
do wait(2)
Willis: I'm just glad you didn't die for it.
do wait(3)
Archie: I...[wait=0.5] still think about them.
Archie: My comrades.
Archie: I never would’ve made it home if Pike hadn't showed me mercy.
Archie: I wonder if he’s okay. 
Archie: If they suspect him of letting me go.
Willis: What would they do to him?
Archie: ...I don’t know.
Archie: That's what scares me.
do wait(2)
Willis: You know what I think?
Willis: He knew the risk he was taking.
do setSpriteFrame("Willis",0)
Willis: and he'd want you to put all that behind you.
Archie: Yeah...
Archie: I guess he would.
do wait(2)
do setSpriteFrame("Archie",1)
do wait(1)
Archie:  Thanks Will.
do setSpriteFrame("Willis",1)
Willis:  Where’d you be without my wise-ass.
Archie: Probably dead in some ditch.
Willis: That’s right! So next time you better sit your ass down and listen!
do wait(0.5)
do playEntityAnimation("Archie", "Punch")
do wait(1)
Archie: Don’t push it squirt.
Willis: Hahah!
do setSpriteFrame("Archie", 0)
Archie: We better get some shut-eye.
Archie: It's a new life ahead of us.
do wait(1)
do setSpriteFrame("Willis", 0)
do wait(1)
Willis: Let's just sit here for a minute.
Willis: I've never seen this much trees before.
do wait(1)
Archie: ...Sure.
do showCameraOverlay("Black",5)
do wait(5)
Archie-
do wait(1)
Archie, wake up-
do wait(3)
The train stopped.
do changeMap("res://scenes/maps/Forest.tscn","875.0011,734.9305,0")
=> END